Package: alsacap
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ALSA capabilities reporting tool
 A diagnostic tool for listing supported audio capture and playback formats
 on ALSA-compatible sound devices. Useful for debugging audio configurations
 and evaluating hardware capabilities.
